{"title":"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Connie multiplies a number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> as her answer. However, she should have divided the number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get the correct answer. What is the correct answer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b697ffcd38480effce30e0b890add2a65fd24735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7.5\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 120\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"417\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the number, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cda077bd739895233901e0313ea7aae5d46a25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x=60$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f3f18e15c1e5cb4ab85abcb01eac951b30875b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=30$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. Dividing the number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea23c34679a7857eb0928f11195b580e02ba4f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{30}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>A second way to do it is to divide the number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as you multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when you were supposed to divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c3c5dd40e642e0e2f7b2a938f6c8edeed75bc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{60}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8\">2005 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2005\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First <br /> Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl